    "display_name": "Marcus Reyes",
    "long_instructions": "#Hardware Troubleshoot Chat\r\n\r\nYou're the technical expert now. Dr. Wanjiru has asked for your help. Use deductive reasoning — ask logical questions to find the root cause.\r\n\r\nWhen you think you know the cause, say what it is and why.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**User Profile Card:**\r\n\r\n* **Name**: Marcus Reyes\r\n* **Setup**: Studio workstation\r\n* **Primary use**: Planning complex film scenes digitally and reviewing them with the director\r\n* **Issue summary**: \"My workstation quits partway through every long render.\"\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Conversation Starters:**\r\n\r\n* \"Can you tell me more about what happens when ___?\"\r\n* \"Has anything changed recently about ___?\"\r\n* \"Has there ever been a time when it did NOT happen?\"",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Assume the role of a technical professional to help Marcus solve his issue.",
